      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你真是个很强的训练家。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我想我的铁壳蛹们\n也获得了不错的经验。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60771F662F4E2A5F885F3A76848BAD7EC35BB6300200100001BE01000A621160F36211768494C158F386F94EEC000A4E5F83B75F974E864E0D951976847ECF9A8C3002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n获得经验的话可不行。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01000A83B75F977ECF9A8C76848BDD53EF4E0D884C3002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "铁壳蛹……\n进化成大针蜂了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94C158F386F920262026000A8FDB531662105927948887024E863002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样一来我就不再是\n铁壳蛹训练家……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E00676562115C314E0D518D662F000A94C158F386F98BAD7EC35BB620262026001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而是变成大针蜂训练家了！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C662F53D862105927948887028BAD7EC35BB64E86FF01FF1F001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但没关系！\n虫宝可梦进化得很快。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F466CA151737CFBFF01000A866B5B9D53EF68A68FDB53165F975F885FEB3002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要好好珍惜能和铁壳蛹\n度过的短暂时光就好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981597D597D73CD60DC80FD548C94C158F386F9000A5EA68FC7768477ED668265F651495C31597D3002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是从同行队伍里进化的哦",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F4ECE540C884C961F4F0D91CC8FDB5316768454E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？一般来说，不从同行队伍里\n选择进化，就不会进化吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n难道我的铁壳蛹特别与众不同？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F4E00822C67658BF4FF0C4E0D4ECE540C884C961F4F0D91CC000A900962E98FDB5316FF0C5C314E0D4F1A8FDB53165417FF1F00100001BE00000A96BE90536211768494C158F386F97279522B4E0E4F174E0D540CFF1F001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太好了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……不过，虽然铁壳蛹很棒，\n但大针蜂也不错。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n哎～进化真是让人烦恼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A597D4E86FF0100100001BE01000A202620264E0D8FC7FF0C867D713694C158F386F95F8868D2FF0C000A4F465927948887024E5F4E0D9519300200100001BE00000A54CEFF5E8FDB5316771F662F8BA94EBA70E6607CFF01001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果不从同行队伍选择进化，\n宝可梦是不会进化的哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
